    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views. The knotted rhizome silhouette is genuinely irregular and stays interesting from every orbit angle, with cut faces at the branch joints visible in the bottom and top views. Skin texture is photographic and free of stretching in the crevices. Wireframe shows a clean, evenly sized triangulation with no collapsed faces.",
